{% doc %}
  @prompt
    I need a very luxury and well organized way to display all the following information
    
    Cedar Bucket 2026 Pre-Sales – Reserve Your Spot Now
    
    Cedar Bucket has been Oxford’s #1 choice for Ole Miss student moving and storage, voted Best Moving Company and Best Storage Company in Oxford for 2025. We’re opening limited pre-sales for Summer 2026, and space will go fast.
    Our Moving + Storage Premium Package is the ultimate hands-free solution for students and families who want a stress-free summer. We handle everything from start to finish so you don’t have to lift a finger.
     
    What’s Included in the Premium Package
    • White-glove moving service
    Our student movers come pick up your belongings directly from your dorm, apartment, or house. We carefully load your items onto our moving trucks and take them back to our facility to store.
    • Climate-controlled storage
    Your items are stored in our secure, professionally managed facility designed to protect against humidity, heat, and damage.
    • Delivery back to your new space
    When the fall semester begins, we return and set up your belongings where you need them.
    • Ship-to-Storage service
    Can’t bring everything with you? Need to purchase items online? Opt into our ship to service. Simply ship items to the Cedar Bucket, and we’ll place them in your reserved unit on your behalf. 
    • Packing supplies can be provided in advance. Please request for further details! 
    
    Additional Services
    Subject to availability of staff and early scheduling, Cedar Bucket also offers:
    • Handyman services
    • Assembly and disassembly services 
    • Packing services
    Further details can be provided post reservation. 
    
    Why Reserve Now
    • Limited availability – Space sells out quickly.
    • Priority scheduling – Early reservations guarantee your preferred move-in and move-out times.
    • Peace of mind – Secure your storage and avoid last-minute stress.
    
    Your $500 deposit reserves your spot and will be credited toward your final invoice. You may request a refund within 30 days,, A few things - I need to be able to add sections and i'd rather it get stacked on eachother. Put reserve your spot today above why reserve now. Make each section different so it's very easy to read and all the colors are black - I want to be able to add a square image at the top above the hero main title., Few things -  don't change the colors of each block. make them all white i want icons relevant to feature listed and I want the additional services to utilize a multi column view.
    
    The reser

{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-luxury-presale-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 40px;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.body_font.style }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    width: {{ block.settings.hero_image_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.hero_image_size }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.hero_image_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__hero-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f8f9fa;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__hero-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 30px;line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 400;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 80px;
    padding: 60px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__section--cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: #000000;
    border: 2px solid #000000;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__section--cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-luxury-presale__cta-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__section--cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-luxury-presale__cta-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #ffffff;opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__section--cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-luxury-presale__deposit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #ffffff;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__section-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.section_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 40px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__premium-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__premium-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 40px 30px;
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__premium-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__premium-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__premium-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 15px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.item_title_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__premium-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.8;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__additional-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 30px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__additional-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 40px 30px;
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__additional-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__additional-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__additional-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 15px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.item_title_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__additional-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.8;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__why-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__why-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px 20px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__why-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__why-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.item_title_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__why-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__cta-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.cta_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__cta-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 40px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px 40px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_text_size }}px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    min-width: 220px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__button--primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.primary_button_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_button_color }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.primary_button_bg }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__button--primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: {{ block.settings.primary_button_hover_bg }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.primary_button_hover_bg }};
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__button--secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_color }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_border }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__button--secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_hover_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_hover_color }};
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__deposit-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 30px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__deposit-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.deposit_text_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-luxury-presale__additional-note-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 30px 0;
    font-style: italic;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.7;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-luxury-presale-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-presale__section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 30px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-presale__buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .ai-luxury-presale__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-presale__hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: calc({{ block.settings.hero_image_size }}px * 0.8);
      height: calc({{ block.settings.hero_image_size }}px * 0.8);
    }

    .ai-luxury-presale__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.title_size }}px * 0.8);
    }

    .ai-luxury-presale__section-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.section_title_size }}px * 0.9);
    }

    .ai-luxury-presale__premium-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-luxury-presale__additional-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-luxury-presale__why-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-luxury-presale__premium-item-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-luxury-presale__additional-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-presale__premium-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-luxury-presale__why-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-luxury-presale-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if block.settings.hero_image %}
    <div class="ai-luxury-presale__hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-luxury-presale__hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 800}}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.hero_image.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.hero_image.width }}"
          height="{{ block.settings.hero_image.height }}"
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <div class="ai-luxury-presale__hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-luxury-presale__hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-luxury-presale__hero-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-luxury-presale__header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <h1 class="ai-luxury-presale__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.main_title }}</h1>
    <p class="ai-luxury-presale__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.main_description }}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-luxury-presale__section-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <h2 class="ai-luxury-presale__section-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.premium_package_title }}</h2>
    <div class="ai-luxury-presale__premium-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-luxury-presale__premium-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <svg class="ai-luxury-presale__premium-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
          <rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"/>
          <polygon points="16,8 20,8 23,11 23,16 16,16"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/>
          <circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/>
        </svg>
